# Workspace

This Cursor window is a three-root workspace. Only one root is the product.

- **`iamankurj.com`** — working tree. New Once-UI app being built from scratch. All edits go here.
- **`references`** — design and layout inspiration only. Do not modify it as the app.
- **`legacy`** — the current live site (`legacy/iamankurj.com`). Use it for content, IA, and behavior reference. Do not treat it as the app to ship.

## Product

Personal site revamp. UI uses **once-ui-system** (`@once-ui-system/core`). Prefer its components, tokens, and layout primitives over ad-hoc styling.
